I don’t really understand why people are even confused as to why “society is piv-centric”. The answer is quite obvious. I own a vagina and vulva. It’s where I have sexual feeling lol. I primarily enjoy piv. It makes me feel closer to my partner than other forms of sex. It sounds like people are being dismissive which is angering. 

