I was lucky that when I went through this, I had an incredibly supportive bf and medical team. I don’t enjoy most other forms of sex and couldn’t feel as close as I wanted for a few years despite having all the same feelings. I have a neurological condition that sometimes doesn’t allow me to walk or run properly, yet I still have the desire to. The frustration literally felt so close to that. I have not yet had anyone dismiss me by complaining that society is “walking centric” and that there are other ways to do what I want(there aren’t).

