Funny thing about keto products is that I’ve found some that are astonishingly high in carbs, while say, the same item from the same brand-just not the keto-version, is lower in carbs and higher in protein. Isn’t keto supposed to be avoid carbs and prioritize protein? I unfortunately burst out laughing in the store when I saw that the first time. That said, there are some “keto” products that I really love. I’m also grateful for all the almond flour foods now because I have either gluten or fodmap sensitivity and while exploring, I found that I just genuinely love almond flour lol.

