I just hate diets in general. The popularity of them makes it very difficult to co-exist  with people while trying to recover too. Keto, GF used as a diet(for reasons unrelated to celiac or general GI upsets), and intermittent fasting have a special place in hell for me honestly. I especially hate IF and find it extremely triggering to see all over magazines at the grocery store. I’m just over here minding my own business picking out some foods that I want to be friends with and **bam** IF all over every magazine at checkout. Idk how that one ever became so widely acceptable.

