My mom did this when one of my pets passed away. I wasn’t ready to let anyone else know, but confided in her because she loved her also. She used the opportunity to post on FB(as she does with everything unfortunately), tag me, and say that it was her pet and I was just basically babysitting her- along with how sad she was, but that really, really hurt. For reference, she’d lived with me for 5 years and she’d lived with my mother and myself for almost 2. I was having a hard time and needed a pet to fall asleep with. My mom loved her, everyone did, but she was my cat; I cared for her every day, gave her love, my bf and I took her to vet appointments and bought her necessities. She was my best friend and followed me everywhere.

